  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "This is Squeaky. Squeaky is a mouse. Squeaky is very small. Squeaky is a brown mouse. Squeaky has a home. Squeaky's home is under a big tree. Squeaky likes her home. Her home is warm. Squeaky sees green grass. Squeaky sees red flowers. Squeaky is happy here. Squeaky is a happy mouse. One day, Squeaky sees food.",
      "The food is big cheese. The cheese is yellow. The cheese is very big. The big cheese is in a big box. The box is a brown box. The box is very big. Other mice see the box. Other mice are big mice. Big mice want the cheese. Big mice are sad. Big mice are not in the box. The big box is closed for big mice. Squeaky looks at the box.",
      "Squeaky sees a small hole. The small hole is on the brown box. Squeaky is a small mouse. Squeaky runs to the hole. Squeaky goes in the hole. Squeaky is in the box. Squeaky is in the big box. Squeaky gets the big yellow cheese. Squeaky eats the cheese. Squeaky is very happy. Squeaky is a clever mouse. Small is very good. Small is special."
    ],
